    "name": "Fields of Fortune",
    "steam_appid": 3649980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Grow, care \u2013 or automate everything!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5d4e4676b4fbb2d8d76b41b11ac6eb3f.poster.avif?t=1755556189\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5d4e4676b4fbb2d8d76b41b11ac6eb3f.webm?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5d4e4676b4fbb2d8d76b41b11ac6eb3f.mp4?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your favorite crops, tend your fields with care and harvest them with pride \u2013 or let your machines do the hard work! Craft unique items, complete quirky town quests, or sell your treasures at the market. Want to just collect everything that sparkles? Go for it \u2013 it\u2019s your adventure, your pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gently automated \u2013 if you want it. Fully relaxed \u2013 if you need it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude93 Logging like a pro!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/3699a38e67657cd1999212168d8b511d.poster.avif?t=1755556189\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/3699a38e67657cd1999212168d8b511d.webm?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/3699a38e67657cd1999212168d8b511d.mp4?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trusty harvest bot takes care of it all: chopping trees, planting saplings, and sending logs via conveyor belts straight to the sawmill. There, they\u2019re fully automated into tidy wooden planks \u2013 efficient, sustainable, and surprisingly cute. Perfect for your next building project!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26f5 Set sail \u2013 and explore the unknown!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.poster.avif?t=1755556189\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.webm?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.mp4?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into your little boat and head to procedurally generated islands full of surprises. Discover new plants, meet strange creatures, and uncover hidden treasures. Everything you collect can be brought back home \u2013 who knows what the next island has in store?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Your own paradise \u2013 your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Fields of Fortune</i>, you start on a small island with just a few tools and a big idea: to build a farm of your own. Plant fields, place buildings freely, and turn your land into a thriving little homestead \u2013 by hand or fully automated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock tools, production chains, and new islands. Trade your goods in town, take on optional quests, and earn rewards. Animals are part of your farm too \u2013 feed and care for them, build cozy enclosures, and collect what they produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play relaxed or optimized \u2013 it\u2019s entirely up to you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded Features at a glance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 A peaceful pixel world focused on farming, crafting &amp; animal care<br>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Buildings and paths you can place freely<br>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Procedurally generated islands with new plants &amp; resources<br>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Trading in town and optional quests with rewards<br>\ud83c\udf73 A simple cooking system with real recipes<br>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f No time pressure \u2013 play at your own pace</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Grow, care \u2013 or automate everything!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5d4e4676b4fbb2d8d76b41b11ac6eb3f.poster.avif?t=1755556189\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5d4e4676b4fbb2d8d76b41b11ac6eb3f.webm?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5d4e4676b4fbb2d8d76b41b11ac6eb3f.mp4?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your favorite crops, tend your fields with care and harvest them with pride \u2013 or let your machines do the hard work! Craft unique items, complete quirky town quests, or sell your treasures at the market. Want to just collect everything that sparkles? Go for it \u2013 it\u2019s your adventure, your pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gently automated \u2013 if you want it. Fully relaxed \u2013 if you need it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude93 Logging like a pro!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/3699a38e67657cd1999212168d8b511d.poster.avif?t=1755556189\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/3699a38e67657cd1999212168d8b511d.webm?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/3699a38e67657cd1999212168d8b511d.mp4?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trusty harvest bot takes care of it all: chopping trees, planting saplings, and sending logs via conveyor belts straight to the sawmill. There, they\u2019re fully automated into tidy wooden planks \u2013 efficient, sustainable, and surprisingly cute. Perfect for your next building project!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26f5 Set sail \u2013 and explore the unknown!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.poster.avif?t=1755556189\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.webm?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.mp4?t=1755556189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into your little boat and head to procedurally generated islands full of surprises. Discover new plants, meet strange creatures, and uncover hidden treasures. Everything you collect can be brought back home \u2013 who knows what the next island has in store?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Your own paradise \u2013 your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Fields of Fortune</i>, you start on a small island with just a few tools and a big idea: to build a farm of your own. Plant fields, place buildings freely, and turn your land into a thriving little homestead \u2013 by hand or fully automated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock tools, production chains, and new islands. Trade your goods in town, take on optional quests, and earn rewards. Animals are part of your farm too \u2013 feed and care for them, build cozy enclosures, and collect what they produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play relaxed or optimized \u2013 it\u2019s entirely up to you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded Features at a glance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 A peaceful pixel world focused on farming, crafting &amp; animal care<br>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Buildings and paths you can place freely<br>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Procedurally generated islands with new plants &amp; resources<br>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Trading in town and optional quests with rewards<br>\ud83c\udf73 A simple cooking system with real recipes<br>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f No time pressure \u2013 play at your own pace</p>",
    "short_description": "Relax and build the farm of your dreams \u2013 or automate everything for maximum efficiency. Fields of Fortune combines cozy farming, animal care, and exploration with deep automation systems for players who love to optimize.",
